{
  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "main_12_level_main_12-02_end",
  "groupId": "main_12",
  "stageId": "main_12-02",
  "title": "Benevolent Betrayal",
  "storyCode": "12-3",
  "avgTag": "After Operation",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/en/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_12-02_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "bb19e5735cbca389596d68c90eb58084a5c8adedbe4c3a65ed89049feb452998",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lt. Colonel Lettou",
      "text": "Come in.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Golding",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lt. Colonel Lettou",
      "text": "You're here, Golding.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Golding",
      "text": "Lettou... You know us better than I ever imagined.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lt. Colonel Lettou",
      "text": "What do you mean?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Golding",
      "text": "The Londinium Self-Salvation Corps.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Golding",
      "text": "Where did you get this information from?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lt. Colonel Lettou",
      "text": "Does it matter?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lt. Colonel Lettou",
      "text": "Have a seat, Lady Golding. Please, there is no reason for you to feel anxious.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lt. Colonel Lettou",
      "text": "This war is not between you and I.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Golding",
      "text": "Answer me, Lt. Colonel.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lt. Colonel Lettou",
      "text": "I know why you came, Golding. You want to buy time.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lt. Colonel Lettou",
      "text": "You are under the impression you have enough leverage to discuss terms. You think you can still help your friends.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lt. Colonel Lettou",
      "text": "How regrettable. I thought you would be wiser.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Golding",
      "text": "We had a conversation not too long ago.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Golding",
      "text": "You said you did not want to see Londinium become the next Lingones.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Golding",
      "text": "Take a look around us. Take a look at the deep abyss that Londinium is plunging into.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Golding",
      "text": "Is this the choice you made for yourself that you spoke about?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lt. Colonel Lettou",
      "text": "Golding... Didn't you rebut me on that?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lt. Colonel Lettou",
      "text": "Correct, we are plunging toward that abyss. War has begun. War once tore apart Gaul, our homeland.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lt. Colonel Lettou",
      "text": "What will it tear apart this time? Maybe it will be the Sarkaz. Maybe it'll be Victoria.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Golding",
      "text": "You know how disastrous this will be. Hundreds of thousands... Millions of people will—",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lt. Colonel Lettou",
      "text": "Will bleed, die, and buried by this era.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Golding",
      "text": "You know that better than anyone!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lt. Colonel Lettou",
      "text": "That is correct. I know this very well, but I must also admit that it was you who opened my eyes. <i>You</i> made me reflect on my decision.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lt. Colonel Lettou",
      "text": "If I had to question my conscience—",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lt. Colonel Lettou",
      "text": "I would not have cared nearly as much.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lt. Colonel Lettou",
      "text": "Let us cast aside those hypocritical high hopes of 'mankind' or 'civilization,' Golding.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lt. Colonel Lettou",
      "text": "When we were young, we talked freely of these subjects and, with nothing but admiration in our hearts, sung the praises of the outstanding men and women in history.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lt. Colonel Lettou",
      "text": "Mankind, the master of all things! Our intelligence and bravery set us apart from wild beasts and graced these lands with this radiant miracle!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lt. Colonel Lettou",
      "text": "But if we simply lifted our heads from the books and compare, we would realize how close their endings are to the reality before us.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lt. Colonel Lettou",
      "text": "The same downfalls, the same rottennesses, the same self-destructions.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lt. Colonel Lettou",
      "text": "What if all those things we sing the praises of were nothing but temporary illusions? What if believing that they are eternal makes us naive?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lt. Colonel Lettou",
      "text": "What if destruction was our true nature?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Golding",
      "text": "You weren't so pessimistic before, Lettou.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lt. Colonel Lettou",
      "text": "Pessimistic.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lt. Colonel Lettou",
      "text": "Golding, you are so kind with your choice of words. You described my crazed musings as just 'pessimistic.'",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lt. Colonel Lettou",
      "text": "I thought I warranted harsher criticism.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Golding",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lt. Colonel Lettou",
      "text": "It seems... you are not as resolute as I thought you would be.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lt. Colonel Lettou",
      "text": "I am simply... exhausted.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lt. Colonel Lettou",
      "text": "I merely started to try facing reality. It is very painful, but I have no other choice.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lt. Colonel Lettou",
      "text": "As for the conversation we had the other day, I can now offer you a new answer.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lt. Colonel Lettou",
      "text": "I did not choose any missions for myself, Lady Golding.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lt. Colonel Lettou",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lt. Colonel Lettou",
      "text": "I only wanted to survive... the ceaseless destruction.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lt. Colonel Lettou",
      "text": "It's pitiful and weak, insignificant and inadequate, but this is the answer I arrived at, and it is the only one I have to offer.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lt. Colonel Lettou",
      "text": "What else can I do?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Golding",
      "text": "You're a soldier. You should've...!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lt. Colonel Lettou",
      "text": "Followed orders? Whose orders should I have followed? The King is dead, the Sarkaz run the parliament, and each duke has his own master plan.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Golding",
      "text": "You could have—",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lt. Colonel Lettou",
      "text": "—become a hero?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lt. Colonel Lettou",
      "text": "At what cost?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lt. Colonel Lettou",
      "text": "What if the price... is not one that I can afford?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lt. Colonel Lettou",
      "text": "When you walked into the room, did you see the eyes of the guard standing by the door?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lt. Colonel Lettou",
      "text": "The officers under me, my comrades, and those bewildered young men... Till has five children, Sasan's mother has been paralyzed for three years, and Totten's brother has Oripathy.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lt. Colonel Lettou",
      "text": "The vampires will suck their blood dry.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Golding",
      "text": "Bowing down will not prevent anything.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lt. Colonel Lettou",
      "text": "At the very least... Nothing has happened yet, as of today.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lt. Colonel Lettou",
      "text": "Golding, it's my hope that you survive this as well, speaking personally.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lt. Colonel Lettou",
      "text": "Fundamentally, you and I might just be of a kind. It's only that I have chosen to give up, while you are still standing firm.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Golding",
      "text": "You and I are nothing alike.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lt. Colonel Lettou",
      "text": "You asked me where I obtained the information on the Londinium Self-Salvation Corps.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lt. Colonel Lettou",
      "text": "Very well, I shall answer you. From a cowardly teacher.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Golding",
      "text": "What are you saying...?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lt. Colonel Lettou",
      "text": "Look at yourself, Golding. Your blunders and the tracks you left behind are owed to your cowardice and fear.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lt. Colonel Lettou",
      "text": "Sentimental kinds have never been a good fit for intelligence work. You've known that from the start.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Golding",
      "text": "No, it can't be!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lt. Colonel Lettou",
      "text": "There's been a lot of chatter on my communications here.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Self-Salvation Corps Fighter",
      "text": "The Sarkaz ambushed... the Camden Borough safe house... We.... Their forces...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Self-Salvation Corps Fighter",
      "text": "Alert... The safe house at Auchterigg...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Self-Salvation Corps Fighter",
      "text": "Hello? Can anyone hear me? This is the Magna Borough safe house. We're under...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Golding",
      "text": "No...!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lt. Colonel Lettou",
      "text": "Golding, they are dying because of you.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lt. Colonel Lettou",
      "text": "You pushed them into the fire.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lt. Colonel Lettou",
      "text": "This is what your 'fight' brings.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lt. Colonel Lettou",
      "text": "And for that, I can only mourn.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ascalon",
      "text": "There's too many men. They're well-equipped, and they're working far too well with each other.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ascalon",
      "text": "Mercenaries aren't capable of this. These are military elites.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ascalon",
      "text": "Each and every one of them is a bloodthirsty machine who dug his way out of a thousand battles.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Indra",
      "text": "Out of the way, the lot of ya!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Morgan",
      "text": "Indra, watch your back!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Siege",
      "text": "This isn't going to work. We are on the back foot right now.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ascalon",
      "text": "I will locate the position of their commander. Amiya, maintain formation. Don't stop.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "I-I got it!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dagda",
      "text": "Damn, there's more of them down this alley!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Siege",
      "text": "Stay close, Doctor. We will cut our way through!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Siege",
      "text": "!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Siege",
      "text": "Who's that?!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "Doctor, did you hear that? That voice...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dagda",
      "text": "Watch out for their Arts! Cut through this danger zone!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "Hold on tight, Doctor.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Let's listen to that voice.",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "We have to give it a shot.",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Indra",
          "text": "I hate being ordered around! Tsk, fine!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Indra",
          "text": "Bloody... That's a wall there!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Siege",
          "text": "No...",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Siege",
          "text": "Some kind of illusion, perhaps? Charge through it!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Indra",
          "text": "*pant*...*pant*....",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Indra",
          "text": "There's no one I hate more than a sneaky bastard like you! Show yourself!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Indra",
          "text": "I said, show yourself!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "Doctor, behind me.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "Who are you?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Siege",
          "text": "You are... the man behind Allerdale.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Siege",
          "text": "Show yourself.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Siege",
          "text": "I won't say it again.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "???",
          "text": "Please lower your hammer, Your Highness. You are merely wasting your strength.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "???",
          "text": "As heir to the throne—from a certain viewpoint, at least—you should have a bit more patience.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "???",
          "text": "You said so yourself not too long ago. That we should have... a 'conversation.'",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Siege",
          "text": "You had the Self-Salvation Corps tapped.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "???",
          "text": "Their evacuation plan will be successful. Do note that this is a promise, not sarcasm.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "???",
          "text": "My sincerest pleasure to meet all of you, ladies and gentlemen. I hope there yet remains room for our objectives to coexist.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Dagda",
          "text": "An ashen trilby...?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "???",
          "text": "Very perceptive, Lady Isabelle Montague. I should have expected no less from a scion of the Count of Manchester. Indeed, we are often referred to as the 'Trilby Ashers.'",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "???",
          "text": "Should you have the chance, please send your mother my regards.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Dagda",
          "text": "You—",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "'Trilby Asher'",
          "text": "Please, there is no need for alarm, Lady Montague. I harbor no ill will against you and your friends, at the moment.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ascalon",
          "text": "Is the Arts gimmick you have over there a gesture of your goodwill, too?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ascalon",
          "text": "I'm not fond of having conversations next to a pile of explosives.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "'Trilby Asher'",
          "text": "This is merely a precaution.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ascalon",
          "text": "Well then, here's a precaution, too.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "'Trilby Asher'",
          "text": "Lower your weapon, Miss Ascalon. This is not worth it.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "'Trilby Asher'",
          "text": "Rhodes Island Pharmaceuticals, made a series of passage and call permit requests for so-called 'industrial waste recycling and processing' purposes, currently hiding within the territory of the Duke of Gododdin.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "'Trilby Asher'",
          "text": "Currently six hundred and thirty-one kilometers away from Londinium.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "And what if we are?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "'Trilby Asher'",
          "text": "Miss Amiya, I surmise your recycling work is proceeding apace?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "You know Rhodes Island well.",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "Looks like the Victorian bigwigs aren't completely oblivious to us.",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "'Trilby Asher'",
          "text": "We do merely what must be done.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "'Trilby Asher'",
          "text": "You have been very careful. You charted your course and built a well-hidden supply network around your ship. You wish to avoid Victoria's attention.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "'Trilby Asher'",
          "text": "And you almost fooled us.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "'Trilby Asher'",
          "text": "Regardless of whether your intentions are good or otherwise, wouldn't you agree that discretion is the worst quality there is to a ruler?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Who do you serve, Mr. 'Trilby Asher?'",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "'Trilby Asher'",
          "text": "If at all possible, I would say that I serve Victoria.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "'Trilby Asher'",
          "text": "Alas, the reality is that I serve only a small part of Victoria. This small part is more than enough to keep me well occupied, however.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Which means you work for one of the dukes.",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": []
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "If the Duke of Wellington saw us as a threat—",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": []
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Rhodes Island would already have been attacked.",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": []
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "The Duke of Windermere's control has yet to reach Duke Gododdin's territory. Not by a long shot.",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": []
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "From what I know, the Duke of Normandy is more interested in business.",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": []
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Most other dukes are fence sitters.",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": []
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "You work for Caster.",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "'Trilby Asher'",
          "text": "'Doctor,' the commander of Rhodes Island... There exists very little information on you. We were under the impression that this was due to a lack of importance.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "'Trilby Asher'",
          "text": "We will reevaluate our internal appraisal.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "What is Rhodes Island worth to that 'part of Victoria' you speak of?",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "'Trilby Asher'",
          "text": "We actually do not have much of an interest in a so-called pharmaceutical company that deals in waste recycling.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "'Trilby Asher'",
          "text": "But your operator has a very unique background. Moreover, she possesses something important.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Siege",
          "text": "You've failed once, but you still haven't given up.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "'Trilby Asher'",
          "text": "This is my job, Your Highness. Let us not make things harder for each other.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "'Trilby Asher'",
          "text": "This sword is nothing more than a heavy rod of iron in your hands.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "'Trilby Asher'",
          "text": "What do you intend to do with it? Can you really cut through the Catastrophe that looms above us?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "'Trilby Asher'",
          "text": "It is a mere tale. You cannot wield it to its true potential.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Siege",
          "text": "What does Duke of Caster want to do with it, then?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "'Trilby Asher'",
          "text": "To fulfill a promise.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Siege",
          "text": "A promise?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "'Trilby Asher'",
          "text": "To bring her followers peace and safety.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "'Trilby Asher'",
          "text": "We do indeed have certain... technologies that can immediately put this blade to good use, just as the Sighs of Kings once sheltered Londinium.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "'Trilby Asher'",
          "text": "The Duke wishes for this blade to become a turning point for unity.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Siege",
          "text": "In that case, those who aren't on your side will deservedly be swallowed by the Catastrophe.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "'Trilby Asher'",
          "text": "That is how it will become that turning point.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ascalon",
          "text": "(Doctor, I will make my move in three seconds. We must escape this situation.)",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ascalon",
          "text": "(Our operators on the landship are more than capable of taking care of the crisis that could soon unfold... and so we have to take this risk.)",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ascalon",
          "text": "(Three.)",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ascalon",
          "text": "(Two.)",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ascalon",
          "text": "(One.)",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "???",
          "text": "All of you seem pretty tense. Perhaps I came at a bad time?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ascalon",
          "text": "—",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ascalon",
          "text": "Right on time.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ascalon",
          "text": "Ines.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ines",
          "text": "Mr. 'Trilby Asher,' you have to admit that you came well-prepared.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ines",
          "text": "Thirteen small communication stations, with four of them triggered passively. They were set up to automatically send out orders if they don't receive your message after ten minutes.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ines",
          "text": "I didn't want to venture a guess as to what orders they were meant to send out, so I took the liberty of crushing them all.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ines",
          "text": "I hope you don't mind.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ines",
          "text": "Your subordinates were very strong, even after they heard the word Vampire.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ines",
          "text": "That said, I believe that aside from the Sarkaz Royal Court, there are certain others hiding in the city who would be very interested to learn of their existence.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ines",
          "text": "Tell me, where do you suppose I should take them?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "'Trilby Asher'",
          "text": "Ines, former Sarkaz mercenary... It's hardly surprising that you are still alive. We've determined for some time now that someone was behind all these little tricks around Londinium.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "'Trilby Asher'",
          "text": "You've done very well.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "'Trilby Asher'",
          "text": "We know that there is a sizable number of Sarkaz mercenaries inclined to leave the Military Commission's control, but we both know that does not come without a cost, don't we?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "'Trilby Asher'",
          "text": "Your business partner... might be in fairly dire straits.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ines",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ines",
          "text": "Perhaps we should be a little more blunt with each other.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ines",
          "text": "I know you have more tricks up your sleeve, and you know we still have some trump cards in our hand. Let's stop probing each other.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ines",
          "text": "Your shadow tells me you are wavering.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "'Trilby Asher'",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "'Trilby Asher'",
          "text": "Very well. Let's make a deal.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "'Trilby Asher'",
          "text": "I have a tricky mission, but as you can see, I am not much for fighting and adventure.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ines",
          "text": "So you want someone to die in your stead.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "'Trilby Asher'",
          "text": "I have faith in your abilities.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "'Trilby Asher'",
          "text": "Certainly you have already seen the airship that is currently parked at the now-isolated Norport Borough.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "'Trilby Asher'",
          "text": "Make your way there and get your hands on its schematics.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "What's in it for me?",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "'Trilby Asher'",
          "text": "You get to live. For now.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "'Trilby Asher'",
          "text": "You, your friends, your allies, your wounded, and your landship all get to remain alive for the time being.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "'Trilby Asher'",
          "text": "This is no trouble at all to Victoria, but as for the rest of you...",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": []
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Deal.",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": []
    }
  ]
}
